        {"@type":"Question","name":"Is OHCO a good massage chair brand?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"OHCO is widely considered a premium massage chair brand, distributed through Furniture For Life and known for design-led Japanese aesthetics, the Sens8 4D mechanism, the Movesync dual massage mechanism (M8 Neo platform), MaxTrack coverage, and sensory features like Bluetooth Audio Immersion and aromatherapy."}},
