        {"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between OHCO M8 Neo and OHCO M8 Neo LE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The OHCO M8 Neo LE is the limited-edition expression of the M8 Neo platform. Both share the Sens8 mechanism, Movesync dual massage mechanism, MaxTrack coverage, TheraElliptical calf kneading, Bluetooth Audio Immersion, aromatherapy, and the M-Sense Light Pool. The LE adds exclusive finishes, upgraded materials, and limited production positioning for buyers who want the most exclusive OHCO ownership experience."}},
