        {"@type":"Question","name":"Is OHCO better than Panasonic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If you are comparing OHCO vs Panasonic, the right answer depends on what you value. OHCO leans into Japanese-inspired design, shiatsu-inspired choreography, sensory immersion, and living-room integration. Panasonic is often considered by buyers who prioritize precision engineering and deep-tissue feel. The smartest path is to compare OHCO and Panasonic side by side in a showroom."}},
