    <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:24px">OHCO may not be the right fit if you are shopping mainly by lowest price or if another premium chair feels better after a side-by-side showroom test. The R6 is best for design-conscious buyers, the M8 Neo is best for the full technology platform, and the M8 Neo LE is best for buyers who want the most exclusive OHCO experience.</p>
