      <h2>Sens8 4D Mechanism &amp; Movesync Dual Massage Mechanism</h2>
      <p>OHCO's Sens8 4D mechanism is the core of the lineup — a responsive massage engine that varies depth, speed, and pressure rather than running a fixed roller pattern. It appears on the R6, M8 Neo, and M8 Neo LE, and is one of the main reasons shoppers compare OHCO in person rather than from specs alone.</p>
      <p>The Movesync dual massage mechanism is one of the biggest reasons to compare the OHCO M8 Neo platform in person. Instead of relying on a single roller path, the M8 platform layers back, neck, shoulder, and sensory features into a more dimensional session. This is the difference most reviewers notice between the R6 and the M8 Neo / M8 Neo LE during a side-by-side demo.</p>
