    <div class="or-feature-box">
      <div class="or-eyebrow">Sensory Environment</div>
      <h2>Bluetooth Audio Immersion, M-Sense Light Pool &amp; Complete Sensory Environment</h2>
      <p>OHCO goes beyond massage with a complete sensory environment. Bluetooth Audio Immersion lets you connect your smart device to play music, podcasts, calming soundscapes, or guided meditation during your session. You can connect a smart device to play your own playlists, then layer the session with aromatherapy for scent-based relaxation and an air ionizer for a fresher ambient feel.</p>
      <p>The M-Sense Light Pool creates a soft glow around the chair before and during use, helping the experience feel more like a daily wellness ritual than a routine. These sensory features are most fully expressed on the M8 Neo and M8 Neo LE, which is one of the clearest reasons buyers move up from the R6.</p>
