      <h2>Calf, Foot &amp; Lower-Leg Massage</h2>
      <p>TheraElliptical calf kneading is designed around coordinated compression and rotation, gently compressing and kneading the sides of the calves while rear calf rollers work along the back of the lower leg. The movement is inspired by how a shiatsu master gently compresses, releases, and works through the lower leg, leaving your calves refreshed without relying on simple squeezing alone.</p>
      <p>The goal is to leave your calves feeling relaxed, supported, and ready for the rest of the day. The coordinated compression and roller movement can support a lower-leg session that feels focused, layered, and complete — particularly on the M8 Neo and M8 Neo LE.</p>
