      <div class="or-faq-item"><div class="or-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>How much does an OHCO massage chair cost?</h3><button class="or-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="or-faq-a"><div class="or-faq-a-inner"><p>OHCO massage chair price depends on the model, finish, availability, delivery options, warranty coverage, and current promotions. The OHCO R6 is typically the most accessible model in the lineup, the OHCO M8 Neo sits in the flagship premium range, and the OHCO M8 Neo LE is the ultra-premium limited-edition option. Speak with a specialist for current OHCO M8 price and R6 pricing.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="or-faq-item"><div class="or-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>What is the OHCO M8 price?</h3><button class="or-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="or-faq-a"><div class="or-faq-a-inner"><p>OHCO M8 price refers to the current pricing for the OHCO M8 Neo platform, which includes the Movesync dual massage mechanism, MaxTrack coverage, Bluetooth Audio Immersion, aromatherapy, and the M-Sense Light Pool. Pricing varies with finish, availability, financing, and current promotions — check the OHCO M8 Neo massage chair product page or speak with a specialist for live pricing.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="or-faq-item"><div class="or-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>What is the difference between OHCO R6 and OHCO M8 Neo?</h3><button class="or-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="or-faq-a"><div class="or-faq-a-inner"><p>The OHCO R6 is the design-forward entry into the lineup with a refined Mid-Century Modern footprint, while the OHCO M8 Neo is the flagship platform with the Movesync dual massage mechanism, MaxTrack extended track, TheraElliptical calf kneading, Bluetooth Audio Immersion, aromatherapy, and the M-Sense Light Pool. The R6 chair suits buyers who lead with design; the M8 Neo suits buyers who want the full technology stack.</p></div></div></div>

