      <div class="or-faq-item"><div class="or-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Can I try an OHCO massage chair before buying?</h3><button class="or-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="or-faq-a"><div class="or-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes. Massage Chairs and More is built for in-person comparison, so you can try the OHCO R6, OHCO M8 Neo, and OHCO M8 Neo LE side by side in our showroom before you decide. Comparing OHCO models in person is the best way to judge body fit, headrest feel, calf sequence, and overall comfort.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="or-faq-item"><div class="or-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Should I read OHCO massage chair reviews before visiting a showroom?</h3><button class="or-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="or-faq-a"><div class="or-faq-a-inner"><p>Reading OHCO massage chair reviews, OHCO chair reviews, and model-specific notes like an OHCO R6 review, OHCO M8 Neo review, or OHCO M8 Neo LE review can help you shortlist the right model. The best OHCO massage chair review is the one that helps you match the model to your body, room, and budget.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="or-faq-item"><div class="or-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Is OHCO better than Panasonic?</h3><button class="or-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="or-faq-a"><div class="or-faq-a-inner"><p>If you are comparing OHCO vs Panasonic, the right answer depends on what you value. OHCO leans into Japanese-inspired design, shiatsu-inspired choreography, sensory immersion, and living-room integration. Panasonic is often considered by buyers who prioritize precision engineering and deep-tissue feel. The smartest path is to compare OHCO and Panasonic side by side in a showroom.</p></div></div></div>

      <div class="or-faq-item"><div class="or-faq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');var a=this.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.style.maxHeight?null:a.scrollHeight+'px'"><h3>Can I buy an OHCO massage chair online?</h3><button class="or-faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle">+</button></div><div class="or-faq-a"><div class="or-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes. You can shop OHCO massage chairs online at Massage Chairs and More, an authorized OHCO dealer. Many shoppers research the OHCO R6, OHCO M8 Neo, and OHCO M8 Neo LE online, then book a showroom demo before they buy.</p></div></div></div>

